{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Melee</strong> is an action Roguelike where you fight your way through a randomly generated dungeon. As you descend deeper, every floor has a unique theme, cast of enemies, bosses and treasure to find. Additionally, you will also acquire stronger weapons and items that empower you on your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll fight your enemies in a fast-paced, melee-oriented combat style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items can be found throughout the dungeon in chests, secret rooms, behind boxes or as drops from stronger monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These will help you immensely, as they empower you with unique abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll encounter a<strong> </strong>lot of interesting enemies and challenging bosses, who are eager to test how well you handle your sword.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeon is randomly generated each run. Well designed and handcrafted rooms are shuffled and placed in a maze/zelda-like structure in a meaningful way.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460770?t=1739720662","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460770?t=1739720662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/90433e566a47b324ef22d1dafe4e8c6545593fdc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739720662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/90433e566a47b324ef22d1dafe4e8c6545593fdc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739720662","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue Melee</strong> is an action Roguelike where you fight your way through a randomly generated dungeon. As you descend deeper, every floor has a unique theme, cast of enemies, bosses and treasure to find. Additionally, you will also acquire stronger weapons and items that empower you on your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll fight your enemies in a fast-paced, melee-oriented combat style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items can be found throughout the dungeon in chests, secret rooms, behind boxes or as drops from stronger monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These will help you immensely, as they empower you with unique abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll encounter a<strong> </strong>lot of interesting enemies and challenging bosses, who are eager to test how well you handle your sword.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dungeon is randomly generated each run. Well designed and handcrafted rooms are shuffled and placed in a maze/zelda-like structure in a meaningful way.</p>","developers":["Szepad"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460770/header.jpg?t=1739720662","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095119,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095119/movie480.mp4?t=1739720660","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095119/movie_max.mp4?t=1739720660"},"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095119/d78934b26bfb7780a59f8eb3cde4f420a9fc4a8b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739720660","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095119/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739720660","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095119/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739720